    "regime_notes": "Validated across the synthetic 15-instrument cross-asset universe from 2020 through 2035, spanning pandemic, inflation/rate, risk-on, and range-bound regimes. IC uncertainty is interpreted conservatively because each cross-section has only 15 instruments; robustness comes from 4,616 daily observations."
